IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pmo-corporation`

-- Portuguese Missions Ordinance 1910, ss 2-8 and the Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_portuguese-missions-ordinance-1910.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`Cardozo himself` MEANS Agent WITH
    `is Antonio Augusto Cardozo` IS TRUE
    `is appointed by the Bishop of Macao as President by instrument in writing` IS FALSE
    `the instrument was produced to the Minister` IS FALSE
    `the Minister approved it` IS FALSE
    `the approval was notified in the Gazette` IS FALSE

`a successor through all four steps` MEANS Agent WITH
    `is Antonio Augusto Cardozo` IS FALSE
    `is appointed by the Bishop of Macao as President by instrument in writing` IS TRUE
    `the instrument was produced to the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the Minister approved it` IS TRUE
    `the approval was notified in the Gazette` IS TRUE

`a successor approved but not yet gazetted` MEANS Agent WITH
    `is Antonio Augusto Cardozo` IS FALSE
    `is appointed by the Bishop of Macao as President by instrument in writing` IS TRUE
    `the instrument was produced to the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the Minister approved it` IS TRUE
    `the approval was notified in the Gazette` IS FALSE

`a successor gazetted without the Minister's approval` MEANS Agent WITH
    `is Antonio Augusto Cardozo` IS FALSE
    `is appointed by the Bishop of Macao as President by instrument in writing` IS TRUE
    `the instrument was produced to the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the Minister approved it` IS FALSE
    `the approval was notified in the Gazette` IS TRUE

`a successor whose instrument never reached the Minister` MEANS Agent WITH
    `is Antonio Augusto Cardozo` IS FALSE
    `is appointed by the Bishop of Macao as President by instrument in writing` IS TRUE
    `the instrument was produced to the Minister` IS FALSE
    `the Minister approved it` IS TRUE
    `the approval was notified in the Gazette` IS TRUE

`a successor chosen orally, not by instrument in writing` MEANS Agent WITH
    `is Antonio Augusto Cardozo` IS FALSE
    `is appointed by the Bishop of Macao as President by instrument in writing` IS FALSE
    `the instrument was produced to the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the Minister approved it` IS TRUE
    `the approval was notified in the Gazette` IS TRUE

`a lease sealed before and signed by Cardozo` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `Antonio Augusto Cardozo`
    `signed by` IS `Antonio Augusto Cardozo`

`a conveyance sealed before and signed by a gazetted successor` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a duly qualified successor Agent`
    `signed by` IS `a duly qualified successor Agent`

`a mortgage sealed before a successor's deposited attorney and signed by the successor` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a qualified successor's attorney under a deposited power`
    `signed by` IS `a duly qualified successor Agent`

`a conveyance by a successor not yet gazetted` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a successor Agent not yet gazetted`
    `signed by` IS `a successor Agent not yet gazetted`

`a lease executed by an attorney with an undeposited power` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `an attorney whose power is not deposited`
    `signed by` IS `an attorney whose power is not deposited`

`a deed sealed with nobody present but signed by Cardozo` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `nobody`
    `signed by` IS `Antonio Augusto Cardozo`

`an unsealed document signed by Cardozo` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS FALSE
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `Antonio Augusto Cardozo`
    `signed by` IS `Antonio Augusto Cardozo`

