#ASSERT NOT `is duly qualified` `a successor whose instrument never reached the Minister`
#ASSERT NOT `is duly qualified` `a successor chosen orally, not by instrument in writing`

#ASSERT NOT `the Gazette is sufficient evidence of qualification` `Cardozo himself`
#ASSERT `the Gazette is sufficient evidence of qualification` `a successor through all four steps`
